This project makes use of code from the following open-source repositories:

  zennit-crp: https://github.com/rachtibat/zennit-crp
  zennit: https://github.com/chr5tphr/zennit

We thank the authors for making their work publicly available.

The bundled copy under `post_hoc_utils/crp/crp/` has been trimmed to the modules required by the PCX OOD
detection method (`CondAttribution`, `ChannelConcept`, `get_layer_names`, and `MaskHook`). PCX also uses
zennit from `post_hoc_utils/zennit/` for LRP composites (`EpsilonPlusFlat`, `SequentialMergeBatchNorm`).

If you use this code, please cite as:

